],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 41 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle saw January to February at 21% of normal and November to December at 23%. So far in 2026 on the middle, February to March sat at 33% and March to April at 41%. Grid 17523 had its driest year in 2011 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
